# Playwright MCP cache / browser artifacts.
.playwright-mcp/

# nix/devenv, for machines that build this repo with nix rather than mise. `devenv.nix`,
# `devenv.yaml` and `devenv.lock` are tracked; everything devenv and direnv generate is not.
.devenv/
.devenv.flake.nix
devenv.local.nix
.direnv/
# `.envrc` is per-machine, not per-repo: a Gearflow slot is handed one by the provisioner
# and has two exports appended to it. Tracked, every slot of this repo reads dirty for ever
# — which is how a finished slot stops being reusable, and how one `git add -A` commits a
# machine's own paths.
.envrc

# The per-machine environment a slot or a laptop renders. The key-set it fills is
# `local-dev/configs/symphony/env.template` in the gf_engineering workspace.
.env
